WEBVTT

00:09.009 --> 00:10.802
[surgeon] Are we sure
the patient is doing okay?

00:10.885 --> 00:13.930
[anesthetist] His BP is dropping again.
Hang on. Let me check.

00:14.014 --> 00:15.557
[machine beeping]

00:27.652 --> 00:28.945
[shaky breathing]

00:30.613 --> 00:31.448
[whimpers]

00:32.157 --> 00:33.283
[sobbing]

00:34.451 --> 00:36.327
[gentle piano music playing]

00:42.625 --> 00:43.710
[sniffles]

00:43.793 --> 00:45.336
[sobbing]

00:51.551 --> 00:52.886
[inhales sharply, exhales]

01:01.102 --> 01:02.228
[nurse] You should eat these.

01:04.689 --> 01:06.149
You need to eat well today.

01:06.775 --> 01:08.902
- Thank you. I will.
- You're welcome.

01:15.325 --> 01:16.451
[inhales sharply]

01:17.285 --> 01:18.328
[exhales deeply]

01:31.966 --> 01:35.637
Uh, excuse me, but the girl that was here.
Did you see where she went?

01:35.720 --> 01:37.430
Uh, she left a while ago.

01:37.514 --> 01:38.932
Do you know when?

01:39.516 --> 01:40.850
[woman] About ten minutes ago.

01:42.560 --> 01:43.436
Thank you.

01:48.108 --> 01:49.192
[groans]

01:49.275 --> 01:51.277
[breathing deeply]

02:10.505 --> 02:11.506
[music ends]

02:12.757 --> 02:14.843
- [cell phone vibrating]
- [sighs]

02:22.559 --> 02:24.686
- [line ringing]
- [Gun-woo ragged breathing]

02:45.582 --> 02:47.667
[footsteps approaching]

02:48.251 --> 02:49.419
[surgeon] Excuse me.

02:50.753 --> 02:53.256
You are Hong Woo-jin's guardian, right?

02:53.965 --> 02:55.258
Uh, yes.

02:56.092 --> 02:57.719
The operation went well.

02:58.386 --> 03:02.223
We'll have to monitor his progress,
but the surgery was successful.

03:02.974 --> 03:04.142
[exhales]

03:06.144 --> 03:07.353
[whimpers]

03:08.146 --> 03:09.564
[Gun-woo inhales sharply]

03:10.565 --> 03:12.108
[sobbing] God, thank you.

03:14.944 --> 03:16.029
Thank you so much.

03:19.991 --> 03:21.284
[surgeon] Hang in there.

03:21.367 --> 03:22.869
Yeah.

03:24.495 --> 03:26.497
[Gun-woo sobbing]

03:32.462 --> 03:33.546
[sobbing]

03:35.590 --> 03:37.175
[theme music playing]

03:58.905 --> 04:02.283
BLOODHOUNDS

04:15.922 --> 04:16.965
[Gun-woo grunts]

04:17.757 --> 04:20.718
MARINE SPIRIT!
KIM MYEONG-GIL

04:32.146 --> 04:34.816
[Gun-woo grunting]

04:41.698 --> 04:42.532
[sighs]

04:47.870 --> 04:49.872
[alarm ringing]

04:52.208 --> 04:53.459
[grunts]

04:57.046 --> 04:57.880
[ringing ends]

04:59.549 --> 05:00.383
[chuckles]

05:02.010 --> 05:03.761
Hey. [inhales sharply]

05:03.845 --> 05:05.555
Gets me every time.

05:07.098 --> 05:07.932
Let's go.

05:10.393 --> 05:11.769
[Gun-woo grunts]

05:19.152 --> 05:20.611
Whoa!

05:22.488 --> 05:24.073
[uplifting music playing]

05:25.283 --> 05:26.117
Let's run.

05:36.753 --> 05:38.755
[music builds]

05:51.809 --> 05:53.061
[Gun-woo exhales sharply]

05:54.687 --> 05:55.813
- [Gun-woo grunts]
- Woo!

05:56.898 --> 05:57.857
Ah!

05:59.192 --> 06:00.234
[Woo-jin grunts]

06:01.110 --> 06:02.195
[Gun-woo grunts]

06:04.655 --> 06:05.615
[grunts]

06:08.451 --> 06:09.285
[grunts]

06:09.786 --> 06:10.745
[exhales]

06:12.205 --> 06:13.206
[grunts]

06:15.583 --> 06:16.417
[grunts]

06:20.838 --> 06:21.672
[grunts]

06:24.717 --> 06:25.551
[grunts]

06:27.970 --> 06:28.805
[grunts]

06:28.888 --> 06:30.014
- Eighty-six!
- Eighty-six!

06:31.015 --> 06:31.891
[both] Eighty-eight!

06:31.974 --> 06:33.601
- Eighty-nine!
- Eighty-nine!

06:34.310 --> 06:35.561
- Ninety!
- Ten more!

06:36.187 --> 06:37.730
One! [grunting]

06:37.814 --> 06:38.689
- Two!
- Two!

06:39.190 --> 06:40.358
- Three!
- Three!

06:42.944 --> 06:43.945
- Twelve.
- [exhales]

06:44.904 --> 06:46.030
Thirteen.

06:47.156 --> 06:48.825
- [grunts]
- Fourteen.

06:48.908 --> 06:50.118
Good morning, sir.

06:51.411 --> 06:53.538
- Good morning, sir.
- [panting]

06:56.249 --> 06:57.375
[Mr. Oh clears throat]

06:59.502 --> 07:00.878
[somber music playing]

07:06.467 --> 07:07.301
Continue.

07:11.514 --> 07:12.432
- [grunts]
- Fifteen.

07:12.515 --> 07:13.850
[uptempo electronic music playing]

07:13.933 --> 07:14.934
- [grunts]
- Sixteen.

07:15.017 --> 07:17.103
[both] One, two, three, four! [grunting]

07:17.603 --> 07:19.689
One, two, three, four, five!

07:19.772 --> 07:21.691
One, two, three, four! [grunting]

07:22.191 --> 07:23.943
One, two, three, four! [grunting]

07:24.444 --> 07:25.862
One, two, three, four! [grunting]

07:26.404 --> 07:27.947
One, two, three, four!

07:28.573 --> 07:30.491
One, two, three, four!

07:31.451 --> 07:32.326
[Woo-jin groans]

07:36.247 --> 07:37.415
[music intensifies]

07:37.498 --> 07:38.374
[exhales deeply]

07:39.667 --> 07:41.335
[Gun-woo grunting]

07:43.671 --> 07:44.589
[shouting]

07:44.672 --> 07:45.548
[shouting]

07:45.631 --> 07:47.633
[both shouting]

07:49.093 --> 07:50.553
You did it! Yes!

07:51.304 --> 07:52.430
[Woo-jin cheering]

07:53.222 --> 07:54.140
[Woo-jin laughing]

07:54.223 --> 07:56.017
[both grunting]

07:58.102 --> 08:00.104
- [Woo-jin] Whoa!
- Good job. Get up.

08:02.607 --> 08:05.193
What we want to do is topple them
and knock them off balance, right?

08:05.276 --> 08:07.028
- So I think--
- [Mr. Oh] Hey, guys.

08:07.737 --> 08:09.238
I think we should have a talk.

08:09.864 --> 08:11.073
[Gun-woo exhales deeply]

08:12.408 --> 08:14.035
I already told you both no.

08:14.619 --> 08:17.288
If you go back there, you're gonna die.

08:18.581 --> 08:21.584
We understand
why you would be worried about us, Mr. Oh.

08:21.667 --> 08:23.294
Then why don't you listen to me?

08:23.836 --> 08:25.004
To be rebellious?

08:25.505 --> 08:28.090
[Gun-woo] Uh, Mr. Oh, if I may,

08:28.174 --> 08:29.800
let me tell you what I think about this.

08:30.301 --> 08:31.260
[inhales]

08:31.886 --> 08:33.429
After all the experience we've gathered,

08:33.513 --> 08:35.097
I believe we can fight
Kim Myeong-gil and win.

08:36.182 --> 08:37.433
[sighs]

08:40.603 --> 08:42.897
Yang-jung and Du-yeong are dead.

08:43.648 --> 08:44.774
How can you win?

08:45.358 --> 08:47.944
By following all the instructions
that Mr. Choi gave us.

08:48.778 --> 08:49.612
Uh.

08:50.112 --> 08:52.949
Too many people have had their family
and things they love taken away

08:53.032 --> 08:53.866
by Kim Myeong-gil.

08:53.950 --> 08:57.245
[inhales sharply] Mr. Choi said
that if we gather those people

08:57.328 --> 08:59.539
and combined our resources
that we'd be sure to win.

09:00.456 --> 09:01.332
Everyone's in hiding

09:01.415 --> 09:03.584
because they know
that they don't stand a chance alone,

09:03.668 --> 09:06.045
but if others like me and Woo-jin
decide to show up,

09:06.128 --> 09:07.713
I'm sure they're gonna want to help us.

09:08.798 --> 09:11.926
What if… Kim Myeong-gil gets to you first?

09:12.009 --> 09:13.844
Oh, you don't have to worry
about the two of us.

09:13.928 --> 09:14.929
Woo-jin has fully healed,

09:15.012 --> 09:18.182
and I've gone up two weight classes,
so my punches are stronger.

09:18.266 --> 09:20.893
We're fully prepared to take him
and his minions down this time.

09:20.977 --> 09:24.564
Between what we've learned
from Mr. Choi, Mr. Lee, and Mr. Hwang,

09:24.647 --> 09:26.232
I'm sure we can beat Kim Myeong-gil.

09:27.650 --> 09:28.484
No.

09:29.151 --> 09:30.444
I won't allow you to.

09:31.612 --> 09:32.738
And that's the end of it.

09:33.823 --> 09:35.533
- [Gun-woo sighs]
- Mm.

10:10.526 --> 10:11.861
[somber music playing]

10:13.112 --> 10:16.532
[Hyeon-ju] Mr. Oh, I'll be in Rome
by the time you read this letter.

10:18.075 --> 10:20.911
I rented out a small room
with the money Grandpa left me.

10:22.955 --> 10:25.791
I had promised him
that we'd all go to Rome together

10:25.875 --> 10:28.044
- after taking down Kim Myeong-gil.
- [breathes deeply]

10:28.127 --> 10:29.420
But I ruined everything.

10:31.464 --> 10:33.841
I won't ask you to understand my actions.

10:34.925 --> 10:38.012
But if I stay here,
I'll keep thinking about Grandpa.

10:38.095 --> 10:39.055
and I can't handle that.

10:40.264 --> 10:42.558
Wherever I go, I'm reminded of him,

10:43.643 --> 10:45.144
and I can't stop crying.

10:46.020 --> 10:47.438
It's driving me crazy.

10:49.023 --> 10:51.233
Things will get better
if I'm somewhere far away.

10:52.693 --> 10:53.527
I love you,

10:54.028 --> 10:54.904
and I'm sorry.

11:00.951 --> 11:02.787
[Gun-woo and Woo-jin grunting]

11:08.584 --> 11:12.338
- Jesus, it hurts so much. [groans]
- What you're feeling isn't pain.

11:13.089 --> 11:14.965
It's the feeling
of weakness leaving your body.

11:15.049 --> 11:16.425
What does that mean?

11:16.509 --> 11:17.468
[Woo-jin panting]

11:17.551 --> 11:19.595
It means you're gonna emerge
stronger than yesterday.

11:19.679 --> 11:21.347
[both grunting]

11:24.141 --> 11:26.185
- [Mr. Oh] Guys.
- [Gun-woo panting]

11:26.268 --> 11:27.228
Follow me.

11:30.856 --> 11:31.691
[Woo-jin] Yes, sir.

11:46.372 --> 11:47.331
[both gasp]

11:49.417 --> 11:53.129
This is the last
of Mr. Choi's emergency money.

11:53.921 --> 11:54.964
Take it and go.

11:55.881 --> 11:59.552
I tried to hold you back
because of my fears, and I'm sorry.

12:00.344 --> 12:02.555
I'll book a room and car for you in Seoul.

12:03.431 --> 12:04.432
Don't get hurt.

12:06.392 --> 12:07.226
Thank you

12:08.018 --> 12:09.103
We appreciate it.

12:12.440 --> 12:13.733
We'll win, no matter what.

12:16.318 --> 12:18.154
[uptempo instrumental music playing]

12:36.964 --> 12:38.215
[music intensifies]

12:51.729 --> 12:52.563
[elevator dings]

12:56.066 --> 12:57.151
[Gun-woo] 809.

13:00.529 --> 13:01.655
Oh, here.

13:05.409 --> 13:06.952
[doorbell ringing]

13:11.457 --> 13:12.374
[woman] Yes?

13:16.879 --> 13:17.838
Yeah, uh, hello.

13:17.922 --> 13:20.633
The two of us were sent here
by Mr. Oh In-muk.

13:29.767 --> 13:30.601
Come in.

13:30.684 --> 13:31.560
Let's go.

13:36.982 --> 13:37.983
[door lock chimes]

13:39.735 --> 13:40.736
[woman sighs]

13:40.820 --> 13:42.780
Now, if I come back

13:42.863 --> 13:45.449
and find the tape's been torn
or moved at all,

13:45.533 --> 13:47.201
I'll report you to the police.

13:47.701 --> 13:48.786
Uh, why?

13:49.495 --> 13:50.871
My underwear is in there.

13:51.622 --> 13:53.624
- Oh, no, that's not gonna to happen.
- Nuh-uh. Nuh-uh.

13:53.707 --> 13:55.334
[light percussion music playing]

13:56.210 --> 13:58.003
There's one bed here and another above.

13:58.087 --> 13:59.713
Who wants the one on top?

13:59.797 --> 14:01.215
- Doesn't matter.
- [Gun-woo] Yeah.

14:01.966 --> 14:03.342
Then you take the top bunk.

14:03.425 --> 14:04.343
Okay.

14:04.426 --> 14:08.931
Uh, excuse me, sorry, but may I ask
how you came to that decision? Hm?

14:10.307 --> 14:11.392
Just because I can.

14:12.643 --> 14:13.477
Oh.

14:16.021 --> 14:17.898
Uh, here's the key card

14:17.982 --> 14:19.984
and the keys for the car
Grandpa told me to rent.

14:22.319 --> 14:25.155
And here's my number,
but don't call me, please.

14:25.239 --> 14:26.073
I'm busy.

14:26.615 --> 14:28.701
- Okay?
- Yeah.

14:29.493 --> 14:30.327
Cool.

14:36.166 --> 14:37.334
[door lock chimes]

14:38.460 --> 14:39.461
Thank you.

14:39.545 --> 14:40.379
See you.

14:42.548 --> 14:43.465
[door lock chimes]

14:43.549 --> 14:44.925
[both sigh]

14:45.426 --> 14:46.343
Hey, wait a sec.

14:46.844 --> 14:49.179
Didn't she just say
that Mr. Oh is her grandpa?

14:49.680 --> 14:51.390
Mm-hm. She did say that.

14:53.726 --> 14:56.729
Ah, they do look alike
now that I think about.

14:56.812 --> 14:59.148
They're both small
and wear glasses. [chuckles]

15:00.399 --> 15:03.235
It seemed like she was forced
to let us stay here. [clicks tongue]

15:03.319 --> 15:04.445
Yeah, it did.

15:05.863 --> 15:06.989
I feel bad.

15:07.072 --> 15:08.532
[sighs] Enough of that.

15:09.158 --> 15:11.535
- Let's wash up and strategize.
- Okay.

15:11.619 --> 15:12.828
[dramatic music playing]

15:12.912 --> 15:15.372
- My stomach really hurts. Out of the way.
- Whoa, ouch.

15:15.873 --> 15:16.707
[Gun-woo groans]

15:18.375 --> 15:19.501
[exhales deeply]

15:24.131 --> 15:24.965
[grunts]

15:32.973 --> 15:33.807
[sighs]

15:36.185 --> 15:37.019
[grunts]

15:37.895 --> 15:38.729
YANG JAE-MYEONG

15:38.812 --> 15:39.647
[Woo-jin] Why him?

15:39.730 --> 15:42.983
Because I think we need to capture
Yang Jae-myeong first to gather intel.

15:43.067 --> 15:43.984
You?

15:46.779 --> 15:48.072
YANG JAE-MYEONG
MR. MOON, PRESIDENT IM

15:48.155 --> 15:50.741
I think we need
to gather our allies first.

15:50.824 --> 15:52.534
We'll be more powerful
if we work together.

15:52.618 --> 15:53.869
That's a good idea.

15:55.663 --> 15:57.247
But how are we going to find this person?

15:57.331 --> 15:58.499
IIL GROUP HEIR

15:58.582 --> 16:00.209
Mr. Choi said he'd be our greatest asset.

16:00.292 --> 16:02.878
[sighs] I was thinking about it
on the way here.

16:02.962 --> 16:05.130
It won't be easy to get him to meet us.

16:05.214 --> 16:07.091
But I'm gonna try to come up with a plan.

16:07.174 --> 16:08.008
Mm.

16:14.014 --> 16:15.307
- Hey, look!
- Hm?

16:16.934 --> 16:18.227
Whoa!

16:21.313 --> 16:22.898
I think this is a convertible.

16:23.399 --> 16:24.733
- [Gun-woo] The roof retracts?
- Yes.

16:25.317 --> 16:26.527
- It's fabric.
- [chuckles]

16:34.034 --> 16:34.952
[knocking at door]

16:36.787 --> 16:37.621
Sir.

16:40.916 --> 16:42.167
There are so many people

16:42.251 --> 16:45.170
who have been screwed over
by Smile Capital just like you.

16:45.254 --> 16:47.673
We're suggesting that we all join forces.

16:47.756 --> 16:52.052
Honestly, the loan sharks in this area
basically all know one another.

16:52.136 --> 16:55.222
If you were to take the lead,
all the others would follow you.

16:58.350 --> 16:59.268
And then what?

16:59.351 --> 17:01.186
You take back your money

17:01.979 --> 17:05.399
and make sure Smile never pulls this shit
with private moneylenders again.

17:06.191 --> 17:08.110
We can obliterate them. Hm?

17:08.193 --> 17:10.612
You've lost a couple hundred million
to them, right?

17:16.660 --> 17:18.037
No, can't do it.

17:18.120 --> 17:19.163
Ah.

17:19.246 --> 17:21.707
If your little plan doesn't work,
I can end up dead.

17:21.790 --> 17:23.375
What about all your money?

17:23.459 --> 17:25.169
Fuck that. It's not worth it, man.

17:26.086 --> 17:27.296
I mean, I can make more.

17:28.297 --> 17:29.840
I'm not getting involved.

17:29.923 --> 17:32.468
You see, I value my life more than money.

17:33.052 --> 17:34.595
- Sir, please--
- Hey.

17:38.932 --> 17:39.892
[sighs]

17:41.685 --> 17:42.519
[sighs]

17:46.315 --> 17:47.191
[sighs]

17:50.444 --> 17:51.779
Hey, what the fuck?

17:53.947 --> 17:54.782
What happened?

17:57.284 --> 17:59.119
Sir? Sir?

18:01.371 --> 18:03.040
[Mr. Moon] Yo, you aren't allowed in here.

18:03.540 --> 18:07.211
Oh, my junior marines!
What are you guys doing here, huh?

18:07.795 --> 18:08.921
Sir, what happened to you?

18:09.755 --> 18:10.589
Huh?

18:11.423 --> 18:13.008
Oh, I uh… [chuckles]

18:13.801 --> 18:14.927
A few days ago,

18:15.427 --> 18:18.430
a bunch of gangsters came in
and took everything I've got.

18:19.640 --> 18:20.557
Why?

18:24.770 --> 18:25.854
[Mr. Moon chuckles]

18:28.107 --> 18:29.108
[chuckles]

18:29.191 --> 18:32.194
I have ten billion won in bonds
that expire within a month.

18:33.153 --> 18:36.532
If you get all of this money back for me,
I'll give you a cut.

18:36.615 --> 18:37.616
[ominous music playing]

18:37.699 --> 18:38.575
Five percent.

18:38.659 --> 18:39.785
[chuckles]

18:39.868 --> 18:42.913
This is way too good to pass up.

18:43.455 --> 18:44.998
Then we should sign it now.

18:46.667 --> 18:47.543
[inhales sharply]

18:47.626 --> 18:49.545
An elegant lady like yourself

18:49.628 --> 18:52.172
probably doesn't know
how these things work.

18:52.256 --> 18:54.550
Uh, these matters

18:55.217 --> 19:00.347
require mutual trust, you know,
to come to an agreement.

19:00.430 --> 19:01.473
[chuckles softly]

19:02.474 --> 19:03.600
[chuckles]

19:06.645 --> 19:07.980
I'll find someone else then.

19:09.273 --> 19:12.526
- Hm.
- Uh, wait. Wait, wait. Hold on, hold on.

19:12.609 --> 19:15.237
Sometimes we can… [chuckles]

19:15.320 --> 19:16.822
…make exceptions.

19:16.905 --> 19:18.532
Now… [chuckles]

19:22.327 --> 19:23.162
MOON GWANG-MU

19:23.245 --> 19:24.788
I found out later

19:24.872 --> 19:28.292
that in the middle of that contract,
written in the fine print,

19:29.001 --> 19:31.712
it said that if I didn't get these bonds
within the month,

19:31.795 --> 19:34.298
I had to pay for half the entire amount.

19:34.381 --> 19:35.841
Yeah, that was in there.

19:35.924 --> 19:37.301
[laughing]

19:39.094 --> 19:41.889
Definitely sounds like
Smile Capital's way of working.

19:42.514 --> 19:43.807
What the fuck it that?

19:43.891 --> 19:46.185
Its CEO is Kim Myeong-gil.

19:47.561 --> 19:49.730
Kim Myeong-gil who worked for Mr. Choi?

19:50.355 --> 19:51.190
Yes.

19:51.273 --> 19:53.483
Where is that son of a bitch now, huh?

19:54.693 --> 19:57.654
Did you hear about
what happened to Mr. Choi, sir?

19:58.363 --> 19:59.239
What?

19:59.948 --> 20:00.824
I'm sorry, but…

20:03.952 --> 20:05.871
Mr. Choi was killed by Kim Myeong-gil.

20:09.917 --> 20:12.461
Uh, what are you guys talking about?

20:12.544 --> 20:16.256
Kim Myeong-gil killed Mr. Choi, Mr. Hwang,
and Mr. Lee. He killed them all.

20:18.050 --> 20:19.051
[sighs]

20:19.134 --> 20:22.012
We've been lying low in the countryside
with Mr. Oh until till now.

20:22.095 --> 20:25.057
Fuck, stop it guys.
This isn't funny, okay?

20:29.186 --> 20:32.272
I said… I said stop it. [chuckles]

20:32.356 --> 20:34.358
I said stop it. This isn't funny at all!

20:37.611 --> 20:38.737
[Woo-jin sighs]

20:40.572 --> 20:41.657
[chuckles]

20:43.575 --> 20:44.993
[slow piano music playing]

20:45.494 --> 20:46.954
[whimpering]

20:51.750 --> 20:52.709
[sniffles]

20:53.460 --> 20:54.294
What?

20:58.423 --> 20:59.967
How could Mr. Choi be dead?

21:01.218 --> 21:02.052
Why?

21:03.762 --> 21:04.805
What do you mean?

21:05.764 --> 21:07.015
Are you saying he's dead?

21:08.684 --> 21:10.811
Come on, fucking answer me, you assholes.

21:10.894 --> 21:11.853
Damn it!

21:11.937 --> 21:12.854
God!

21:13.730 --> 21:15.023
[whimpering]

21:15.691 --> 21:17.526
How could Mr. Choi be dead?

21:17.609 --> 21:19.027
Tell me how, huh?

21:19.695 --> 21:21.280
[sobbing]

21:29.413 --> 21:30.372
[Jae-myeong grunts]

21:34.543 --> 21:36.712
[groaning] Man, I'm tired.

21:36.795 --> 21:37.921
Oh, I'm exhausted.

21:39.506 --> 21:41.049
Let's get some rest.

21:41.133 --> 21:42.217
- Yes, sir.
- Yes, sir.

21:44.052 --> 21:45.304
[tense music playing]

21:47.014 --> 21:48.015
Who's there?

21:51.310 --> 21:52.519
[Woo-jin] It's been a while.

21:54.980 --> 21:56.982
- These motherfuckers.
- Ah, shit.

21:57.733 --> 21:59.943
- [man 1 grunts, groans]
- [Woo-jin grunts]

22:00.944 --> 22:02.029
[Gun-woo grunts]

22:02.112 --> 22:03.071
Uh…

22:10.162 --> 22:13.290
Hey, I'll tell you everything.
Just don't hit me, huh?

22:13.874 --> 22:15.876
Word got around amongst the homeless,

22:15.959 --> 22:18.795
so we've been going around
facilities for the disabled to steal IDs.

22:18.879 --> 22:20.714
We weren't asking about you.

22:20.797 --> 22:22.466
What's going on at Smile Capital?

22:23.133 --> 22:26.011
Oh, well, then you should've been
a little more specific.

22:26.094 --> 22:27.888
Has the casino opened, sir?

22:29.890 --> 22:30.724
Wait a sec.

22:31.224 --> 22:32.267
Hey, look down.

22:33.685 --> 22:34.936
[whispering indistinctly]

22:38.982 --> 22:41.109
Can you maybe try a tough guy act?

22:42.027 --> 22:43.195
How do I do that?

22:43.278 --> 22:45.113
First off, don't be so polite.

22:46.156 --> 22:50.827
[sighs] Dude, that guy is clearly over 40.
I don't want to talk down to him.

22:52.412 --> 22:53.413
All right, okay.

22:53.497 --> 22:56.124
If he speaks down to you,
punch him in the face.

22:57.250 --> 22:58.168
Mm-hm.

23:01.004 --> 23:01.880
[Gun-woo sighs]

23:02.589 --> 23:05.967
Hey, hard to believe, but I'm actually 31.

23:06.051 --> 23:08.970
And I won't speak down to you guys,
so there's no need for any violence.

23:09.054 --> 23:10.764
My body is a wreck right now.

23:11.306 --> 23:12.265
Not too long ago,

23:12.349 --> 23:14.351
a piece of shit
slashed both of my Achilles heels,

23:14.434 --> 23:16.186
and I spent four months
in physical therapy.

23:16.853 --> 23:18.814
That piece of shit is our friend.
Watch your mouth.

23:20.107 --> 23:23.777
What happened was on me.
I totally deserved all of it.

23:25.320 --> 23:26.321
So, back to the casino?

23:26.947 --> 23:27.864
Yes.

23:27.948 --> 23:30.075
I happened to overhear
the director talking on the phone.

23:30.158 --> 23:32.202
Director? What's his name?

23:32.285 --> 23:33.161
Kim Jun-min, sir.

23:35.580 --> 23:36.415
He's alive?

23:36.498 --> 23:39.126
Some piece of shit slashed his neck
with a knife, and he--

23:39.209 --> 23:40.585
[breathes angrily]

23:41.420 --> 23:45.507
Ah, you're on the same team. [laughs]

23:45.590 --> 23:48.301
Okay, I understand everything now, 100%.

23:48.802 --> 23:51.471
I'm gonna watch my mouth now,
so there's no need to hit me.

23:52.305 --> 23:53.765
I fucking hate Kim Jun-min.

23:53.849 --> 23:55.392
That guy's a fucking asshole.

23:55.475 --> 23:57.519
Smile Capital's also a bunch
of motherfuckers.

23:57.602 --> 23:59.396
I'm only in it for the money. That's it.

23:59.479 --> 24:02.190
I'll tell you everything. I've been dying
to tell someone about their bullshit.

24:02.274 --> 24:04.568
All right, we get it.
Please get to the point now.

24:04.651 --> 24:06.611
Based on what I heard on the phone,

24:06.695 --> 24:08.822
they're fighting with Iil Group
over the contract,

24:08.905 --> 24:11.658
so Kim Myeong-gil
is really pissed off lately.

24:12.159 --> 24:13.201
And?

24:13.285 --> 24:15.495
Kim Jun-min is tight with this guy,
Im Jang-do.

24:15.579 --> 24:16.580
He's an asshole too.

24:17.080 --> 24:19.958
He was in charge of dealing with the cops,
but he just disappeared one day.

24:20.041 --> 24:23.044
And recently, Kim Myeong-gil was drinking
at a hostess bar,

24:23.128 --> 24:25.839
got into a fight with some dude,
and ended up breaking his wrist.

24:26.423 --> 24:28.758
So the cops were called in,
and it was a whole scene,

24:28.842 --> 24:30.802
but they swept it all under the rug.

24:31.553 --> 24:34.514
That doesn't usually happen
when the police are called to a scene.

24:35.015 --> 24:36.433
So from what Kim Jun-min said,

24:36.516 --> 24:39.186
Kim Myeong-gil has found a guy
to replace Im Jang-do.

24:39.269 --> 24:41.605
Apparently, he hasn't told anyone
about it yet.

24:42.230 --> 24:43.440
Why?

24:43.523 --> 24:45.233
Because he doesn't trust his own men.

24:46.401 --> 24:47.486
And?

24:47.569 --> 24:50.864
And he also plans on taking over
a golf course in Gyeonggi-do.

24:50.947 --> 24:53.408
That's the reason
why we're busting our balls out here.

24:53.492 --> 24:55.744
We get paid shit,
but they practically work us like mules.

24:55.827 --> 24:57.412
- Right, guys?
- [both moaning]

24:58.872 --> 25:00.999
And that concludes my updates for the day.

25:03.835 --> 25:04.669
Hold on.

25:10.842 --> 25:11.760
[sighs]

25:12.511 --> 25:15.972
You know you're fucked
if we send this to Kim Jun-min.

25:16.056 --> 25:17.140
Keep your mouth shut.

25:17.224 --> 25:18.517
No need to worry, sir.

25:19.017 --> 25:21.811
If you need anything else,
feel free to get in touch.

25:21.895 --> 25:24.648
Just like you, I'd like to see
Smile Capital crash and burn.

25:24.731 --> 25:27.901
So do you think you'll be able to get us
the phone number Iil Group's eldest son?

25:28.568 --> 25:30.403
Oh, no, I don't think I can do that.

25:30.946 --> 25:33.698
People like them are pretty serious
about their privacy.

25:34.241 --> 25:35.116
Oh.

25:35.825 --> 25:37.327
IIL GROUP CHAIRMAN'S ELDEST SON

25:41.122 --> 25:42.541
IIL GROUP HEIR
CONFIDENT TO DEVELOP A GLOBAL HOTEL

25:42.624 --> 25:46.378
Oh, his name is Hong Min-beom.
He has the same last name as me.

25:47.128 --> 25:50.632
Bro, this proves that Seoul has
the best jajangmyeon, right?

25:50.715 --> 25:53.385
- Yeah.
- [keypad beeping]

25:54.928 --> 25:56.805
[woman panting]

25:56.888 --> 25:59.307
Why are you using my computer
without permission?

25:59.391 --> 26:01.726
It's logged into all of my messenger apps.

26:01.810 --> 26:04.646
We're so sorry.
We didn't open any messenger apps.

26:04.729 --> 26:05.855
[panting]

26:05.939 --> 26:07.482
Go to that café next door.

26:07.566 --> 26:09.359
Okay. We're sorry.

26:09.442 --> 26:11.778
- Turn it off.
- [Woo-jin] Got it.

26:11.861 --> 26:13.280
But how about just this once?

26:13.947 --> 26:15.407
[sighs] Hurry.

26:15.949 --> 26:16.825
Yeah, that's all.

26:17.409 --> 26:18.994
- Sorry again.
- [woman] Ugh.

26:19.494 --> 26:21.288
- [woman exhales deeply]
- [lock chimes]

26:21.788 --> 26:22.706
How did she find out?

26:22.789 --> 26:26.209
Uh, the messenger app must've alerted her
when we turned on the computer.

26:26.293 --> 26:27.127
Mm. Mm.

26:28.503 --> 26:29.546
[Woo-jin exhales]

26:35.176 --> 26:36.386
[Woo-jin] Whoa!

26:36.469 --> 26:38.096
- Damn. Look.
- What?

26:38.179 --> 26:41.266
Hong Min-beom has 500,000 followers.

26:42.642 --> 26:43.685
Let's see now.

26:45.729 --> 26:46.605
[music ends]

26:54.070 --> 26:55.697
[ominous music playing]

27:02.370 --> 27:04.331
[goon] Whoa! Stop, stop, stop, stop!

27:27.354 --> 27:28.188
[exhales]

27:29.105 --> 27:29.981
Didn't I say…

27:32.025 --> 27:35.528
to have the contract ready by today,
so I could spend the money?

27:36.112 --> 27:38.031
[inhales sharply] I tried my best,

27:39.532 --> 27:40.909
[spluttering] but my father--

27:40.992 --> 27:43.161
[Mr. Hong groaning]

27:44.579 --> 27:47.040
- [Myeong-gil grunting]
- [Mr. Hong groaning]

27:56.883 --> 27:57.926
Hey, Beom.

27:58.009 --> 28:00.011
[coughing]

28:01.137 --> 28:02.597
[Mr. Hong groaning]

28:05.809 --> 28:07.686
[Mr. Hong yelling]

28:11.272 --> 28:13.942
Please don't kill me.
Please don't. Please.

28:14.025 --> 28:15.402
[Mr. Hong distressed breathing]

28:15.485 --> 28:17.487
[Myeong-gil] Do what I asked you to,

28:17.570 --> 28:19.906
and deliver the contract to me
by this Friday.

28:19.989 --> 28:21.825
If you don't, I'll release the video.

28:21.908 --> 28:25.036
And I will make it look as if
you threw yourself off a building

28:25.120 --> 28:26.329
because of the footage.

28:27.038 --> 28:28.289
[groaning]

28:29.874 --> 28:31.918
Yes. Yes.

28:32.001 --> 28:33.002
[Mr. Hong grunts]

28:33.753 --> 28:36.047
[Mr. Hong grunts, exhales]

28:49.978 --> 28:51.688
[slow instrumental music playing]

28:54.149 --> 28:56.317
[whimpering]

29:08.455 --> 29:09.414
[vibrates]

29:10.248 --> 29:11.166
[inhales sharply]

29:11.249 --> 29:12.083
[exhales deeply]

29:12.167 --> 29:13.042
[sniffles]

29:17.630 --> 29:18.506
[music ends]

29:18.590 --> 29:20.592
[Woo-jin]
Do you want to get rid of Kim Myeong-gil?

29:21.134 --> 29:22.343
We can help you.

29:23.011 --> 29:25.263
What the fuck? Who are these guys?

29:25.764 --> 29:27.599
[uptempo instrumental music playing]

29:28.558 --> 29:31.728
WE KNOW WHERE THE HARD DRIVE
CONTAINING YOUR FOOTAGE IS LOCATED

29:32.937 --> 29:34.272
Let's just meet them.

29:34.355 --> 29:36.149
We better do it quickly.

29:36.858 --> 29:38.359
The contract is due on Friday.

29:39.194 --> 29:41.029
Then ask if they can meet us now.

29:41.112 --> 29:42.572
What do I do if they say yes?

29:42.655 --> 29:44.157
Have them meet you at the bar you like.

29:44.240 --> 29:46.367
They'll show their true colors
once they drink.

29:47.327 --> 29:49.621
- Oh, shit.
- [sighs]

29:51.080 --> 29:53.666
Don't worry.
I can get two of my guys to follow you.

30:07.305 --> 30:08.348
Hey, In-seong.

30:08.431 --> 30:09.599
- Yes, sir.
- Tastes good, right?

30:09.682 --> 30:11.017
Oh, yes!

30:11.100 --> 30:12.393
I told you not to drink.

30:13.102 --> 30:14.562
Uh, right. [clears throat]

30:14.646 --> 30:16.356
[light instrumental music playing]

30:17.315 --> 30:18.566
[Gun-woo] Come on. They're here.

30:21.236 --> 30:23.822
- Hello, sir. Hello, sir.
- [Woo-jin] Hello, sir.

30:28.409 --> 30:30.495
Hey, guys. I'm Min-beom's cousin.

30:31.162 --> 30:32.664
Oh, I'm Kim Gun-woo.

30:33.456 --> 30:36.042
And I'm Hong Woo-jin.
I'm the one who sent you the DM.

30:37.836 --> 30:38.670
Have a seat.

30:39.337 --> 30:41.214
- Yes, sir.
- [Gang-yong exhales deeply]

30:45.635 --> 30:48.805
Let's talk over a few drinks
if you guys don't mind.

30:51.474 --> 30:52.308
Uh…

30:54.686 --> 30:56.145
Uh, I'm really sorry,

30:56.980 --> 30:59.148
but I was attacked and stabbed
by Kim Myeong-gil's men

30:59.232 --> 31:01.943
and they tore my liver, so I can't drink.

31:02.694 --> 31:03.570
[chuckles]

31:04.904 --> 31:06.155
If you don't want to drink,

31:06.990 --> 31:08.658
you can just say so, you know?

31:08.741 --> 31:09.576
[Woo-jin sighs]

31:15.123 --> 31:16.124
[Woo-jin] I’m not lying.

31:16.624 --> 31:18.209
Here, here,

31:19.377 --> 31:20.378
here.

31:22.088 --> 31:23.339
We get it, yeah.

31:23.423 --> 31:25.592
Okay, pull it down.
It’s a disturbing sight.

31:26.092 --> 31:27.677
Why don't you sit this one out?

31:28.678 --> 31:29.596
Were you stabbed too?

31:29.679 --> 31:32.390
Well, actually,
I just don't drink alcohol, sir.

31:32.473 --> 31:33.516
[Gang-yong chuckles]

31:35.143 --> 31:37.478
We’re about to talk about serious stuff.
Let's drink.

31:40.440 --> 31:41.274
[Gun-woo exhales]

31:41.357 --> 31:44.652
Well, what is the point
of us meeting here then

31:44.736 --> 31:46.487
if we're not gonna be open
with each other?

31:46.571 --> 31:49.574
How can we trust you
if you back out of something so trivial?

31:50.158 --> 31:51.075
And to be blunt,

31:52.660 --> 31:55.204
you asked to meet up
because you also need us.

32:02.462 --> 32:03.796
[inhales deeply]

32:03.880 --> 32:06.132
- I’m sure I can have just one drink.
- No!

32:06.215 --> 32:08.843
I'll be the one to…
to have a couple drinks with you.

32:12.597 --> 32:13.473
All right.

32:16.517 --> 32:17.352
Min-beom.

32:18.603 --> 32:19.604
All right.

32:21.814 --> 32:23.024
[Gang-yong inhales sharply]

32:25.443 --> 32:26.361
Now, let's drink.

32:29.572 --> 32:30.657
Cheers.

32:31.407 --> 32:32.241
Cheers.

32:40.208 --> 32:42.961
- [Gun-woo exhales deeply]
- Damn, you're a natural.

32:43.670 --> 32:45.421
Let’s drink from the tall glasses.

32:45.505 --> 32:46.923
These ones are too short.

32:47.006 --> 32:48.508
This is the right way.

32:48.591 --> 32:49.968
- Okay.
- [Gang-yong] Here.

32:50.468 --> 32:51.594
There we go.

33:03.272 --> 33:04.774
[relaxed music playing]

33:35.096 --> 33:36.097
[grunts]

33:36.806 --> 33:39.100
[grunts, exhales deeply]

33:41.185 --> 33:42.395
[gulps] Mm.

33:42.478 --> 33:43.896
Hey, dude. Whoa!

33:43.980 --> 33:45.523
- Slow down.
- Mm-hm.

33:49.402 --> 33:50.903
[electronic music playing]

33:50.987 --> 33:52.071
[exhales deeply]

33:54.699 --> 33:56.659
Much more relaxed now. [chuckles]

33:57.452 --> 33:58.369
[coughs]

34:02.081 --> 34:02.915
Shit.

34:10.840 --> 34:11.924
[exhales deeply]

34:13.468 --> 34:14.302
[grunts]

34:15.720 --> 34:16.763
[groans]

34:22.477 --> 34:23.352
[clears throat]

34:27.982 --> 34:28.816
[exhales]

34:29.400 --> 34:30.443
[laughs]

34:30.526 --> 34:31.611
[Gun-woo chuckles softly]

34:32.111 --> 34:32.987
[Mr. Hong grunts]

34:33.696 --> 34:34.655
[Gang-yong] This is fun.

34:34.739 --> 34:37.075
[Mr. Hong mumbling]
No, hey, listen to me. Hey, man.

34:37.158 --> 34:38.785
I'm so stressed by that son of a bitch.

34:38.868 --> 34:40.703
I knew you were cool
when you raised your shirt.

34:40.787 --> 34:43.081
- I'm your bro.
- [Woo-jin] Yeah.

34:43.164 --> 34:45.333
- Yeah, you're my bro. Pour me another.
- Yes, sir!

34:45.416 --> 34:48.544
[whimpering]
Because of that stupid asshole…

34:48.628 --> 34:49.921
[sighs]

34:50.004 --> 34:52.590
…I lost so much hair from the stress.

34:53.174 --> 34:55.009
I have hemorrhoids.

34:55.593 --> 34:58.262
Earlier he punched me
before I could even speak.

35:00.431 --> 35:04.185
The police commissioner fucking loves me!

35:04.268 --> 35:06.646
When we're together,
he calls me commissioner.

35:06.729 --> 35:09.190
I'm like, "Hey, bro!
Stop calling me that."

35:09.273 --> 35:11.400
"People are gonna get the wrong idea."

35:13.194 --> 35:16.405
Bro, we have to take care of this kid.

35:16.489 --> 35:18.658
He's family. He's good. He's a good kid.

35:18.741 --> 35:22.161
Woo-jin and Gun-woo,
do whatever the hell you want.

35:22.245 --> 35:25.164
Fuck it, all right.
We've got your back till the end of time.

35:25.248 --> 35:26.499
Should I pour you another, sir?

35:26.582 --> 35:28.251
- I can't drink anymore.
- Okay.

35:28.334 --> 35:29.919
I can't because I have hemorrhoids.

35:30.002 --> 35:32.171
[mumbling] I work too much.

35:32.255 --> 35:34.257
[groans] We should keep drinking.

35:38.761 --> 35:39.595
[music ends]

35:43.766 --> 35:44.642
[inhales sharply]

35:51.440 --> 35:52.483
[sighs]

35:54.360 --> 35:55.736
Oh, shit.

35:57.280 --> 35:58.573
[cutlery clanking]

36:06.122 --> 36:06.998
Bro.

36:12.253 --> 36:13.713
[Gang-yong inhales, grunts]

36:14.839 --> 36:16.132
What the hell?

36:18.467 --> 36:19.969
Oh, good morning, Min-beom.

36:21.846 --> 36:22.805
Did you sleep well?

36:24.932 --> 36:26.392
[hesitates] What's going on?

36:26.475 --> 36:27.852
[Woo-jin exhales]

36:27.935 --> 36:30.146
Uh, you brought us over last night

36:30.229 --> 36:32.273
saying we should have a few more drinks
at your place.

36:32.356 --> 36:33.191
Oh.

36:33.691 --> 36:35.568
We were about to wake you up
for instant noodles.

36:35.651 --> 36:37.069
- To cure the hangover.
- [Mr. Hong] Uh-huh.

36:37.153 --> 36:37.987
Have a seat.

36:38.988 --> 36:40.865
- Gun-woo, take this.
- [Gun-woo] All right.

36:40.948 --> 36:42.867
- And I can go wake up Gang-yong.
- [Gun-woo] Okay.

36:42.950 --> 36:44.952
[Mr. Hong] Uh, how much did I drink?

36:49.123 --> 36:49.957
Gun-ho?

36:52.084 --> 36:52.960
Gun-woo.

36:53.044 --> 36:53.961
Oh.

36:55.880 --> 36:57.423
What are we doing?

36:57.506 --> 36:59.383
Oh, Gang-yong is going to communicate

36:59.467 --> 37:01.469
with a computer expert
from the police agency.

37:01.552 --> 37:03.512
That person will hack
Kim Myeong-gil's phone,

37:03.596 --> 37:05.765
and then we'll burn all of the hard drives
in the safe.

37:05.848 --> 37:07.850
[Woo-jin] The noodles are done.
You should eat, bro.

37:08.351 --> 37:10.102
[grunting] Gang-yong, get up.

37:11.020 --> 37:12.355
When Kim Myeong-gil goes to Iil Group

37:12.438 --> 37:14.106
to meet you this Friday
to sign a contract,

37:14.190 --> 37:15.358
that's when you're gonna do it.

37:15.441 --> 37:16.317
Who is?

37:18.402 --> 37:19.278
You.

37:20.988 --> 37:22.865
Right. Of course it's me.
Yeah, let's just eat.

37:22.949 --> 37:25.117
[groans] How much did I drink?

37:25.201 --> 37:27.662
- [Gang-yong grunts]
- Whoa! Be careful.

37:30.081 --> 37:32.458
- Oh!
- Ah, nice.

37:32.541 --> 37:33.501
Enjoy.

37:38.631 --> 37:39.632
[Gang-yong] Mm.

37:40.466 --> 37:42.593
- Thank you for the food.
- Thank you for this meal.

37:49.600 --> 37:51.769
[Gang-yong] It's been so long
since I had this.

37:54.689 --> 37:55.648
[Gun-woo moans]

37:55.731 --> 37:56.816
[music ends]

38:00.569 --> 38:02.196
- [Woo-jin] Whoa.
- [Gun-woo] Whoa.

38:03.447 --> 38:04.407
It's huge.

38:05.199 --> 38:06.784
[Woo-jin] It's so tall.

38:06.867 --> 38:08.202
How many stories is this?

38:10.496 --> 38:11.539
[Gun-woo] Thank you.

38:12.206 --> 38:13.916
- Hello. Hello, sir.
- [Gang-yong] You're here.

38:14.000 --> 38:15.626
- [Gun-woo] Hi, everyone
- [Woo-jin] Hello.

38:15.710 --> 38:16.627
[Gun-woo] Hi.

38:17.795 --> 38:20.131
- Hello.
- Let me introduce you to my team.

38:23.384 --> 38:24.427
Go ahead.

38:25.970 --> 38:27.179
Detective Yoon Han-gu.

38:27.263 --> 38:28.222
Nice to meet you.

38:30.141 --> 38:30.975
- Hi.
- Hello.

38:31.809 --> 38:34.520
I'm Team Leader Kang Tae-yeong
from Cyber Crimes.

38:34.603 --> 38:37.064
I'm not supposed to be here,
but nice to meet you.

38:37.148 --> 38:38.274
- Oh.
- Oh.

38:39.150 --> 38:42.486
Let's also keep my presence a secret.
We're all here in secret.

38:42.570 --> 38:43.529
Okay.

38:43.612 --> 38:47.199
Anyway, Tae-yeong is the leading
cybersecurity expert in the country.

38:47.283 --> 38:49.243
She'll explain
how to hack Myeong-gil's phone,

38:49.327 --> 38:51.787
and then she'll lead you through the steps
to activate the safe.

38:51.871 --> 38:55.416
Right. There are two ways to do it,
and the first way is to use Wi-Fi, yeah?

38:55.499 --> 38:57.251
So I'll install a jammer
in the meeting room,

38:57.335 --> 39:00.421
and that will temporarily block
Internet access.

39:00.504 --> 39:03.758
That will naturally lead the subject
to reconnect to the Wi-Fi again,

39:03.841 --> 39:05.801
but the moment he connects
to the transmitter I made,

39:05.885 --> 39:07.762
I'll be able to access his phone device.

39:07.845 --> 39:10.056
And once I do, it's game over.

39:10.139 --> 39:11.640
I've also researched
the different safe apps

39:11.724 --> 39:13.225
that he's likely to be using.

39:13.309 --> 39:14.935
As for the second method,

39:15.019 --> 39:18.356
it depends if we can get him
to open up a more direct route for us.

39:18.439 --> 39:20.399
You know how these days
we scan personal QR codes

39:20.483 --> 39:21.734
when entering buildings.

39:21.817 --> 39:23.444
I'll make one to post at the entrance.

39:23.527 --> 39:24.403
ELECTRONIC ACCESS LIST

39:24.487 --> 39:25.363
Then have him scan it.

39:25.446 --> 39:26.989
Once that QR code has been scanned,

39:27.073 --> 39:29.367
it'll open a door
for me to again hack into his phone.

39:29.450 --> 39:31.702
We will be using both methods
at the same time, yeah?

39:32.286 --> 39:33.162
Wait.

39:35.998 --> 39:37.249
What do I have to do?

39:37.333 --> 39:41.420
Uh… you just need to make sure
he stays connected to the Wi-Fi

39:41.504 --> 39:42.755
for as long as possible.

39:42.838 --> 39:45.925
I'll have access to his cloud,
but depending on the size,

39:46.008 --> 39:48.552
it could take some time
to rake all of the data, you know?

39:48.636 --> 39:49.720
[Gang-yong] If we're lucky,

39:49.804 --> 39:52.848
we may be able to get evidence
for all of his crimes

39:52.932 --> 39:54.308
and catch his accomplices.

39:55.059 --> 39:55.976
Whoa.

39:56.560 --> 39:57.645
[Mr. Hong] But what if…

39:59.647 --> 40:01.107
that bastard catches on?

40:02.024 --> 40:03.401
What's our backup plan?

40:03.484 --> 40:05.569
- [inhales, sighs]
- [Han-gu clears throat]

40:05.653 --> 40:09.156
We're using both methods at once
to avoid needing a backup plan.

40:09.740 --> 40:10.991
Oh, come on, dude.

40:11.575 --> 40:14.078
What is this? Seriously! [inhales sharply]

40:14.161 --> 40:15.413
[dramatic music playing]

40:15.496 --> 40:16.997
No matter what it takes,

40:17.665 --> 40:20.292
we have to destroy
that fucking hard drive tomorrow.

40:21.168 --> 40:23.003
If it was up to me,
I would just take his phone.

40:23.629 --> 40:25.589
Should be easy. Not so complicated.

40:25.673 --> 40:27.675
What's with all the technical details?

40:28.801 --> 40:30.428
Maybe I can take his phone.

40:31.011 --> 40:31.887
Han-gu.

40:34.390 --> 40:35.224
[sighs]

40:35.891 --> 40:39.103
Uh, may I ask what's on the hard drive?

40:39.186 --> 40:40.521
Oh, shit.

40:40.604 --> 40:42.064
[Gang-yong] You don't need to know.

40:43.983 --> 40:44.817
Got it?

40:45.526 --> 40:46.360
Yeah.

40:47.361 --> 40:48.237
[exhales sharply]

40:50.781 --> 40:52.491
Min-beom, let's get some air.

40:52.992 --> 40:53.909
[smacks lips]

41:06.714 --> 41:07.673
[Mr. Hong sighs]

41:13.929 --> 41:14.805
[Gang-yong sighs]

41:15.306 --> 41:16.807
- Min-beom.
- [sighs]

41:17.766 --> 41:19.018
You must be nervous.

41:20.144 --> 41:22.188
I know it's a difficult operation.

41:23.063 --> 41:25.357
And, of course,
there are also a lot of limitations.

41:25.441 --> 41:26.734
Bro. [inhales sharply]

41:28.527 --> 41:31.822
If we don't erase that hard drive,
I'll never be free of Kim Myeong-gil.

41:31.906 --> 41:33.032
I'll be fucked.

41:33.115 --> 41:35.451
That's why I am going to try my hardest.

41:36.076 --> 41:37.578
Please trust me a little more.

41:42.708 --> 41:43.542
[sighs]

41:44.210 --> 41:45.169
I'll try.

41:46.420 --> 41:47.254
[sighs]

41:48.339 --> 41:49.173
[sighs]

41:49.673 --> 41:52.259
[uptempo electronic music playing]

42:02.353 --> 42:03.896
[jammer beeping]

42:03.979 --> 42:04.855
[exhales sharply]

42:08.275 --> 42:09.777
Whoa. It's gone.

42:15.783 --> 42:17.076
It's gonna work?

42:17.159 --> 42:17.993
Of course.

42:18.577 --> 42:19.995
[tense music playing]

42:57.241 --> 42:58.951
Please take your temperature here.

43:01.537 --> 43:03.080
Scan the QR code with your phone.

43:03.581 --> 43:06.166
[woman]
Shouldn't it be the other way around?

43:06.250 --> 43:08.210
This is how our building does it, Miss.

43:08.919 --> 43:11.505
[chuckles] That's unusual but okay.

43:20.180 --> 43:21.390
So far so good.

43:31.442 --> 43:32.276
[music ends]

43:33.152 --> 43:35.237
- Okay.
- Yes!

43:37.323 --> 43:38.490
[ominous music playing]

43:39.700 --> 43:41.452
[inhales sharply] Oh.

43:42.411 --> 43:43.495
What's wrong? What?

43:43.579 --> 43:45.789
There's seems to be nothing
in the file folders.

43:45.873 --> 43:46.790
Give me a second.

43:47.541 --> 43:49.001
[tense music playing]

43:55.841 --> 43:58.886
The, uh, the safe app you had mentioned,
it's not here.

44:02.556 --> 44:04.058
Are you sure the information was right?

44:04.141 --> 44:05.100
Yeah.

44:05.184 --> 44:06.810
Jang-do was not in a position to lie.

44:10.314 --> 44:11.649
Is this asshole onto us?

44:13.901 --> 44:14.985
[music intensifies]

44:20.324 --> 44:21.450
Oh well.

44:23.118 --> 44:25.496
Director Hong. [laughs]

44:26.413 --> 44:27.706
How are you?

44:43.514 --> 44:44.723
[dramatic music playing]

44:49.478 --> 44:51.397
[sighs] Oh shit.

44:53.982 --> 44:57.945
- What?
- [sighs] There's no safe app on his phone.

45:10.749 --> 45:12.501
[tense music playing]

45:17.923 --> 45:19.299
This fucker has two phones.

45:20.759 --> 45:21.927
What do you mean?

45:22.010 --> 45:23.679
The phone he used
to scan the QR code was black,

45:24.304 --> 45:25.431
but this one's silver.

45:25.514 --> 45:26.724
- Ah.
- Ah.

45:28.600 --> 45:29.435
So what do we do now?

45:29.518 --> 45:31.395
We just need
to get him to connect to the Wi-Fi.

45:41.196 --> 45:43.240
Sir, he's leaving the room.

45:43.824 --> 45:45.033
[sighs]

45:48.996 --> 45:49.997
I'm fine. Don't worry.

45:50.080 --> 45:51.957
- Do you need something? Okay.
- I said I'm fine.

45:52.666 --> 45:53.917
[Mr. Hong panting]

46:00.215 --> 46:01.216
What happened?

46:01.300 --> 46:03.552
[sighs] Kim Myeong-gil has two phones.

46:03.635 --> 46:05.763
The one we managed to get into
didn't have the safe app.

46:06.555 --> 46:08.599
The phone with the app is in that pouch.

46:09.308 --> 46:10.142
And?

46:11.518 --> 46:13.353
We're still trying to figure out
what to do.

46:13.437 --> 46:16.231
There's not enough time left.
The meeting is wrapping up.

46:19.485 --> 46:21.570
[whispering]
Why don't we talk in private for a second?

46:21.653 --> 46:22.821
Oh, shit.

46:22.905 --> 46:24.114
[Gang-yong breathes deeply]

46:24.198 --> 46:25.741
Tae-yeong, Han-gu.

46:25.824 --> 46:28.035
Could you guys give us
just a minute, please?

46:28.619 --> 46:29.495
Uh, yeah.

46:31.622 --> 46:32.456
[door opens]

46:35.209 --> 46:37.419
Min-beom, what did Im Jang-do use
to take the video?

46:38.253 --> 46:39.171
A cell phone.

46:39.254 --> 46:42.216
Isn't there a chance he would've sent
that video to Kim Myeong-gil's phone?

46:42.299 --> 46:43.801
You mean to get confirmation?

46:43.884 --> 46:44.885
Right.

46:44.968 --> 46:48.388
Before you sign the contract,
instruct him to delete the video first.

46:48.472 --> 46:49.306
Simple as that.

46:49.807 --> 46:52.184
Then Kim Myeong-gil will have no choice
but to take out his phone.

46:52.267 --> 46:53.227
What if he doesn't?

46:53.769 --> 46:55.646
What if he says he didn't receive it?

46:56.772 --> 47:00.108
You should ask him to show you
his entire chat history with Im Jang-do.

47:00.192 --> 47:03.028
And tell him that Im Jang-do said
he was going to send it to him.

47:03.111 --> 47:04.530
You serious?

47:04.613 --> 47:06.740
Criminals like Kim Myeong-gil
trust no one.

47:07.324 --> 47:10.410
In order to check
that Im Jang-do finished the job properly,

47:10.494 --> 47:12.913
he would have asked him
to send the video for proof.

47:13.747 --> 47:14.581
[sighs]

47:15.207 --> 47:17.209
[inhales sharply, sighs]

47:21.421 --> 47:22.881
I don't think I can.

47:25.843 --> 47:26.969
You can trust me.

47:27.052 --> 47:28.011
That's not it.

47:28.095 --> 47:29.179
[inhales sharply]

47:29.263 --> 47:31.640
I don't think I have what it takes
to stand up to him.

47:35.394 --> 47:36.478
I'm scared!

47:38.981 --> 47:41.316
Fuck, just looking at him
makes my hands shake!

47:48.282 --> 47:49.116
Min-beom.

47:53.620 --> 47:56.790
Look, you will be able to do this.

47:58.375 --> 48:01.086
I will kick down those doors
at the first sign of trouble.

48:01.587 --> 48:03.839
And if things get out of hand
at any point,

48:05.090 --> 48:07.843
I will use all of our family's resources
to protect you.

48:10.345 --> 48:12.222
So please muster up your courage, okay?

48:18.562 --> 48:21.273
Min-beom, we will barge in there with him.

48:21.940 --> 48:22.858
You can do it.

48:29.364 --> 48:30.282
[inhales deeply]

48:30.991 --> 48:31.909
[exhales deeply]

48:34.828 --> 48:36.204
[suspenseful music playing]

48:43.795 --> 48:45.756
You sure kept us waiting, didn't you?

48:46.590 --> 48:47.633
What were you doing?

48:48.884 --> 48:50.594
Could the lawyers please step out?

48:51.595 --> 48:53.388
I need a moment in private with Mr. Kim.

48:54.097 --> 48:55.015
Okay.

48:55.682 --> 48:56.516
[clears throat]

49:00.938 --> 49:01.813
[sighs]

49:08.946 --> 49:10.697
I'm sure you don't want to be arrested.

49:18.080 --> 49:21.416
What's with… this bravado?

49:21.917 --> 49:23.085
Erase the video

49:24.294 --> 49:25.796
before we sign the contract.

49:28.006 --> 49:28.966
It's not here.

49:30.759 --> 49:32.719
I'll delete it as soon as I get home.

49:32.803 --> 49:33.804
You have my word.

49:33.887 --> 49:34.888
[chuckles]

49:35.764 --> 49:36.890
Don't bother lying.

49:38.141 --> 49:40.560
I know that your guy sent it
to your phone.

49:43.981 --> 49:45.524
I want to see you delete it.

49:53.073 --> 49:55.075
[music building]

50:02.916 --> 50:03.750
[music fades]

50:03.834 --> 50:04.710
[chuckles]

50:11.174 --> 50:12.092
[exhales]

50:21.768 --> 50:23.186
[tense music playing]

50:23.270 --> 50:24.938
- I'll do it now.
- No.

50:26.231 --> 50:27.983
I'm going to delete it myself.

50:28.984 --> 50:29.901
I don't trust you.

50:31.611 --> 50:32.654
And if I refuse?

50:33.905 --> 50:35.699
Then I'm not signing.

50:35.782 --> 50:36.616
[chuckles]

50:37.159 --> 50:38.326
You must be crazy.

50:40.454 --> 50:41.288
Well…

50:43.331 --> 50:46.209
You think my family will sit still
if you lay a finger on me?

50:47.210 --> 50:48.754
I've been so embarrassed,

50:49.713 --> 50:52.215
so I've been trying to take care of this
on my own.

50:53.592 --> 50:57.054
But… my aunt runs the tax department.

50:57.137 --> 50:58.430
One phone call from me,

50:58.513 --> 51:00.974
and within 24 hours,
your company will be audited.

51:01.058 --> 51:01.892
So,

51:02.851 --> 51:04.686
you want to pay tens of billions in taxes?

51:04.770 --> 51:06.521
You want to go there? Huh?

51:14.529 --> 51:15.947
You've become more eloquent.

51:17.824 --> 51:19.201
At least with your threats.

51:20.077 --> 51:21.036
I learned from you.

51:25.373 --> 51:26.333
I like it.

51:27.000 --> 51:28.085
[Mr. Hong chuckles softly]

51:29.503 --> 51:30.378
Well, I don't.

51:32.380 --> 51:34.382
[music building]

51:39.513 --> 51:40.347
[music ends]

51:41.473 --> 51:42.349
[chuckles softly]

51:42.933 --> 51:44.434
[suspenseful music playing]

51:48.939 --> 51:49.815
[Mr. Hong sighs]

51:49.898 --> 51:50.941
WI-FI OFF

51:51.024 --> 51:52.734
WI-FI ON

51:53.735 --> 51:54.694
[Mr. Hong exhales]

51:56.363 --> 51:57.322
[exhales] We're in.

51:58.490 --> 51:59.574
Okay, give me a second.

52:05.372 --> 52:06.289
Ah!

52:06.373 --> 52:07.374
The safe app.

52:07.457 --> 52:08.291
It is here.

52:08.375 --> 52:09.668
- Yes!
- Hell yeah!

52:09.751 --> 52:11.336
- [laughing] Okay
- Shh!

52:11.419 --> 52:13.338
All right, I will break in now, okay?

52:19.928 --> 52:21.805
Will that be all, Mr. Hong?

52:23.557 --> 52:24.599
Now we can sign.

52:27.394 --> 52:29.229
[uptempo electronic music playing]

52:34.234 --> 52:35.110
[exhales]

52:35.652 --> 52:38.405
Okay. Should I go ahead with it now?

52:39.489 --> 52:40.407
[exhales deeply]

52:50.000 --> 52:51.084
Do it.

52:51.168 --> 52:52.169
[Tae-yeong] Okay.

52:57.007 --> 52:58.341
TOTAL INCINERATION IN PROCESS

53:11.396 --> 53:12.230
It's done.

53:12.314 --> 53:13.523
[Gun-woo inhales sharply] Yes.

53:13.607 --> 53:16.401
- Hey, are you 100% sure that it worked?
- [Tae-yeong] Yes, definitely.

53:16.943 --> 53:19.696
- Oh, thank you.
- I'll extract all of the data right now.

53:19.779 --> 53:21.740
Okay, yeah, extract it. Extract it all.

53:24.117 --> 53:25.327
This is all thanks to you two.

53:25.410 --> 53:27.037
- Oh, not at all.
- Not at all.

53:27.120 --> 53:28.622
We'll gather all the evidence
on that phone,

53:28.705 --> 53:31.666
and that bastard Kim Myeong-gil
will end up behind bars, so don't worry.

53:31.750 --> 53:32.876
- Great.
- Great.

53:33.585 --> 53:34.586
[both exhale]

53:42.385 --> 53:45.138
Thanks for your hard work.
Gang-yong will be in touch.

53:45.222 --> 53:47.057
- Okay, thank you.
- Thank you.

53:47.557 --> 53:49.768
There's something
I've been thinking about.

53:50.602 --> 53:52.270
Your wound, your scars.

53:53.355 --> 53:54.981
I'd like to help you get treatment for it.

53:55.065 --> 53:57.859
Oh, I really appreciate it,

53:58.735 --> 54:00.445
but I'm okay.

54:01.112 --> 54:01.988
Are you sure?

54:02.072 --> 54:02.906
Yes.

54:02.989 --> 54:07.994
[inhales sharply] Thanks to this scar,
I was able to meet some amazing people,

54:08.078 --> 54:11.206
and it gave me the strength to carry on
instead of giving up.

54:12.249 --> 54:14.668
So I… [inhales sharply]

54:14.751 --> 54:16.169
I'm okay with my scars.

54:17.003 --> 54:17.921
I understand.

54:19.130 --> 54:20.048
I'll see you guys soon.

54:20.131 --> 54:21.758
- Okay.
- Okay.

54:22.759 --> 54:23.718
Please walk them out.

54:23.802 --> 54:25.011
- [man] Yes, sir.
- I'll say bye here.

54:25.095 --> 54:27.555
- [Gun-woo] Okay, thank you.
- [Woo-jin] Bye. Thank you.

54:29.391 --> 54:30.850
[Gun-woo breathes deeply]

54:30.934 --> 54:33.019
- Thank god it ended well.
- I know, right?

54:35.855 --> 54:37.816
- [Gun-woo] I knew things would go well.
- Uh-huh.

54:37.899 --> 54:39.859
[Woo-jin breathes deeply]

54:40.360 --> 54:42.112
- Oh, and Gun-woo.
- Hm?

54:42.195 --> 54:46.449
Do you remember when Mr. Choi asked
Im Jang-do about the gold bars?

54:47.492 --> 54:50.412
Yeah, uh, about how
only In-beom knows where they are.

54:51.037 --> 54:53.123
Yeah. How much do you think it's worth?

54:54.040 --> 54:55.625
[exhales sharply] I don't know.

54:56.876 --> 54:59.379
My guess is
somewhere around tens of billions.

55:00.547 --> 55:01.423
Wow.

55:03.258 --> 55:05.927
That includes the money
he stole from Mr. Choi, right?

55:06.011 --> 55:06.845
Right.

55:07.595 --> 55:09.931
If the cops let Kim Myeong-gil
slip away again,

55:10.932 --> 55:12.642
he's gonna take the money and gold

55:13.810 --> 55:15.103
and leave the country.

55:16.062 --> 55:19.107
We can't let that happen.
That money belongs to Mr. Choi.

55:19.607 --> 55:20.567
Let's get ready.

55:21.109 --> 55:23.778
Let's chase him down to the end
and maul him to death.

55:23.862 --> 55:24.988
I'm in.

55:30.368 --> 55:32.871
[people laughing]

55:32.954 --> 55:35.081
- [man] Yes, sir!
- [woman] Woo!

55:35.165 --> 55:38.293
- Beom, Jun-min, good work, you guys!
- Sir!

55:38.376 --> 55:41.338
Man, let's go for round two at my place.

55:41.421 --> 55:42.630
[women laughing]

55:44.257 --> 55:45.383
Woo! We're here.

55:45.467 --> 55:47.010
Don't you smell something?

55:49.095 --> 55:51.389
Hm, it does kind of smell like smoke.

55:53.141 --> 55:54.267
[tense music playing]

55:54.351 --> 55:55.393
Quiet.

55:59.439 --> 56:00.273
Don't.

56:06.154 --> 56:07.280
[keypad beeping]

56:10.116 --> 56:10.950
[grunts]

56:18.166 --> 56:20.335
Fucker!

56:21.336 --> 56:23.296
[screaming]

56:26.508 --> 56:27.467
[woman] Go.

56:37.769 --> 56:39.938
CHOI TAE-HO

56:42.774 --> 56:43.817
[sighs]

56:45.610 --> 56:46.444
[sighs]

56:51.950 --> 56:53.410
[line ringing]

56:54.536 --> 56:55.453
[grunts]

56:58.248 --> 57:00.667
- [Myeong-gil] Where are you?
- [man] Working overtime, sir.

57:01.376 --> 57:03.878
I'll send a driver
with a phone over right now.

57:04.421 --> 57:05.964
I need you to find someone.

57:06.047 --> 57:09.050
- How many people?
- For now, just an old man.

57:09.634 --> 57:10.510
How urgent is this?

57:10.593 --> 57:12.470
If you find him by tomorrow at noon,

57:13.388 --> 57:14.639
I'll pay you triple.

57:16.474 --> 57:17.725
All right, sir.

57:17.809 --> 57:22.689
SERIOUS CRIME INVESTIGATION
DIVISION UNIT 1

57:24.816 --> 57:26.818
[electronic music playing]

59:12.507 --> 59:13.341
[music ends]
